export function initialDame(){const pieces=Array(100).fill(null);for(let r=0;r<10;r++)for(let c=0;c<10;c++)if((r+c)%2===0&&((r<4)||(r>5)))pieces[r*10+c]={player:r<4?1:0,king:false};return {pieces,turn:0,forced:null,over:false,winner:null,quiet:0,captured:[]};}
function movesFrom(s,i,captureOnly=false){const p=s.pieces[i];if(!p||p.player!==s.turn)return[];const r=Math.floor(i/10),c=i%10,result=[];for(const [dr,dc]of [[1,1],[1,-1],[-1,1],[-1,-1]]){let seen=null;const max=p.king?9:2;for(let step=1;step<=max;step++){const rr=r+dr*step,cc=c+dc*step;if(rr<0||rr>=10||cc<0||cc>=10)break;const j=rr*10+cc,q=s.pieces[j];if(q){if((s.captured||[]).includes(j)||q.player===p.player||seen!==null)break;seen=j;if(!p.king&&step!==1)break;}else if(seen!==null){result.push({from:i,to:j,capture:seen});if(!p.king)break;}else{if(!captureOnly&&(p.king||step===1&&dr===(p.player===0?-1:1)))result.push({from:i,to:j,capture:null});if(!p.king)break;}}}return result;}
export function dameMoves(s){if(s.over)return[];if(s.forced!==null)return movesFrom(s,s.forced,true);const all=s.pieces.flatMap((p,i)=>p?.player===s.turn?movesFrom(s,i):[]);const takes=all.filter(m=>m.capture!==null);return takes.length?takes:all;}
export function moveDame(state,from,to){const move=dameMoves(state).find(m=>m.from===from&&m.to===to);if(!move)return state;const s=structuredClone(state),piece=s.pieces[from];s.captured??=[];s.pieces[from]=null;s.pieces[to]=piece;if(move.capture!==null)s.captured.push(move.capture);s.quiet=move.capture!==null?0:s.quiet+1;if(move.capture!==null&&movesFrom(s,to,true).length){s.forced=to;return s;}for(const i of s.captured)s.pieces[i]=null;s.captured=[];const row=Math.floor(to/10);if((piece.player===0&&row===0)||(piece.player===1&&row===9))piece.king=true;s.forced=null;s.turn=1-s.turn;const counts=[0,0];s.pieces.forEach(p=>{if(p)counts[p.player]++;});if(counts[0]<=1||counts[1]<=1){s.over=true;s.winner=counts[0]<=1?1:0;}else if(!dameMoves(s).length){s.over=true;s.winner=1-s.turn;}else if(s.quiet>=80){s.over=true;s.winner=null;}return s;}
export function initialLudo(){return {tokens:[Array(4).fill(-1),Array(4).fill(-1)],turn:0,die:null,over:false,winner:null};}
export function ludoLegal(s){if(s.over||s.die===null)return[];return s.tokens[s.turn].flatMap((p,i)=>(p===-1?s.die===6:p<57&&p+s.die<=57)?[i]:[]);}
export function ludoCell(player,progress){return progress<0||progress>=52?null:(progress+player*26)%52;}
export function moveLudo(state,index){if(!ludoLegal(state).includes(index))return state;const s=structuredClone(state),p=s.turn;let progress=s.tokens[p][index];progress=progress<0?0:progress+s.die;s.tokens[p][index]=progress;const cell=ludoCell(p,progress);if(cell!==null&&cell!==0&&cell!==26)for(let i=0;i<4;i++)if(ludoCell(1-p,s.tokens[1-p][i])===cell)s.tokens[1-p][i]=-1;if(s.tokens[p].every(n=>n===57)){s.over=true;s.winner=p;}if(s.die!==6)s.turn=1-p;s.die=null;return s;}
